    <briefdescription>
<para>Serialize the remarks to YAML. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>One remark entry looks like this: <mdash/> !&lt;TYPE&gt; <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_pass" kindref="compound">Pass</ref>: &lt;PASSNAME&gt; Name: &lt;REMARKNAME&gt; <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_loc" kindref="compound">DebugLoc</ref>: { File: &lt;SOURCEFILENAME&gt;, Line: &lt;SOURCELINE&gt;, Column: &lt;SOURCECOLUMN&gt; } <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_function" kindref="compound">Function</ref>: &lt;FUNCTIONNAME&gt; Args:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>&lt;KEY&gt;: </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_debug_loc" kindref="compound">DebugLoc</ref>: { File: &lt;FILE&gt;, Line: &lt;LINE&gt;, Column: &lt;COL&gt; } ... </para>
    </detaileddescription>
